From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dominik Weber <doweb85@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:07:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 27/27] byteplan: 8-row matmul tiles for src0 of at most 8 rows

The 4-row hc inject ran in a 64-row tile with 60 rows of padding: kernel_mul_mm_n8 takes 8 src0 rows and 8 src1 rows
per threadgroup (one simdgroup), with the same MMA sequence per element. 4 x 2048 x 10240 q8_0: 428 -> 312 us.
---
